Counsel have asked us whether we are able to say to the court, through them, that we are satisfied the PG Case Leads will remain involved in the case until the end of the year.
Nic and I took the liberty to speak to them at lunchtime. They say they confirm they are happy to give that reassurance if the following conditions are met:-


that a working agreement is put in place to be signed off by you and us applying to the five of them, ie Michael Burke, Priyanka Gladson, Matt Hunt,
 Georgie Fallows, and Sarah Bingham - not to the wider PG NOx team;
that for the remainder of their tenure at PG, the five of them solely work on common cost matters across the Pan NOx Litigations;
that they are not responsible for conducting PG only related work;

that PG will update their various Claimant Committees that the case leads have stepped down and who the new case leads are within a reasonable time frame
 and in any event no more than 14 days;
That all sounds reasonable, so can you confirm you are content with this so we can give the assurance to the court.
