Anna,
&nbsp;
Coming back on this we set out below a summary text (not the actual drafting) for a side letter with LD covering the points discussed previously.&nbsp; Essentially this is to enable the
 PG team to continue as before in terms of the work they are doing and plan to do.&nbsp; Supervision of that team will remain with PG.&nbsp; LD will have a monitoring and general matter supervising role consistent with its LS role and duties.&nbsp;

&nbsp;
Please let us know if PG has any comments or edits on this.
&nbsp;
Best regards,
&nbsp;
Neil
&nbsp;
Draft:
&nbsp;
(The Side Letter is to be privileged and confidential (as is the Pan NOx AA)).

&nbsp;
1. Terms and phrases defined in the Pan NOx Agency Agreement (“Pan NOx AA”) shall have the same meaning in the Side Letter, unless otherwise defined herein.&nbsp;

&nbsp;
2. The following terms and phrases shall have the following meanings:
&nbsp;
“GLOs” means the group litigation orders of the Court in respect of the Lead Cases, listed on Annex A.
