Dear Harriet,&nbsp;Confirmation of Resignation&nbsp;Thank you for your email dated 28 November 2025, confirming your decision to resign from your position with Pogust Goodhead. Further to the email you received from Raminder, we write to confirm the terms of your termination and provide details on your final pay. &nbsp;To confirm, your final day of employment will be 27 February 2026.&nbsp;Please continue to act in the best interests of Pogust Goodhead and fulfil your duties in line with your employment contract until your final working day.&nbsp;Confidentiality and Post-Employment ObligationsWe remind you that your contractual obligations relating to confidentiality, intellectual property, and post-termination restrictions remain in full effect during and after your employment. This includes all clauses in your contract regarding:&nbsp;Confidentiality and data protection;Intellectual property created during your employment; andObligations and restrictions that apply following termination.&nbsp;You must not remove, copy, or forward any Pogust Goodhead data or client information to personal or external accounts. Any such action would be in breach of your agreements and potentially client agreements, and you risk legal action against you for any breach.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Return of Company Property and DataPlease return all Pogust Goodhead property (including laptops, phones, passes, and any related accessories) to the IT Department by your final working day.&nbsp;In accordance with company policy:Failure to return company property may result in a deduction of £1,500 from your final pay, and £50 for any unreturned company office pass.You must ensure all Pogust Goodhead data is deleted from any personal devices used during your employment.Please also remove Pogust Goodhead accounts or multi-factor authentication from any personal devices and update your social media to reflect your departure.&nbsp;Upon leaving Pogust Goodhead, you are obligated to: Return all Pogust Goodhead equipment to the IT Department;Provide any PIN or access codes set up on your Pogust Goodhead equipment;Remove any Pogust Goodhead Multi-Factor Authentication on personal devices;Notify the IT Department of any systems you have sole access to;Update social media to show you no longer represent or work at Pogust Goodhead;Ensure the IT Department is notified of any unrecorded work in progress on your devices (Messenger chats, call logs, etc.);Return any documents relating to Pogust Goodhead cases;Ensure that no Pogust Goodhead data, especially client data, resides on any personal device or storage; andShutdown any accounts for services that use your Pogust Goodhead email address, e.g. Google Accounts with @pgmbm.com or @pogustgoodhead usernames.&nbsp;Final Pay and DocumentationYour final salary, including any outstanding holiday entitlement or adjustments, will be processed in the February 2026 payroll.Your final payslip, P45, and other payroll documents will be available via BrightPay. Please ensure that you download any documentation you wish to retain, as access will be withdrawn upon the completion of your employment.&nbsp;If you have any questions regarding the above, please do not hesitate to contact us.&nbsp;We want to take this opportunity to thank you for your contribution to Pogust Goodhead and wish you every success in your future endeavours.&nbsp;Kind regards,HR Team&nbsp;From: Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 04 December 2025 09:59To: Harriet Harper &lt;hharper@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: HR Team &lt;hr@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: Re: Resignation&nbsp;Dear Harriet,&nbsp;Thank you for your email. I am sorry to hear you are leaving.&nbsp;I confirm your last day will be 27 February 2026.&nbsp;The HR team will write to you under separate cover to advise you of your leaving arrangements i.e. returning equipment and final pay.&nbsp;&nbsp;Kind regards,Raminder&nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Raminder&nbsp;GrewalGlobal&nbsp;HR&nbsp;Director+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;718From:&nbsp;Harriet Harper &lt;hharper@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;Friday, November 28, 2025 12:29To:&nbsp;Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; HR Team &lt;hr@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;Resignation&nbsp;Dear Raminder&nbsp;Pursuant to clauses 2.1 and 26 of my Employment Contract, please consider this formal notice of my resignation from my position as Associate at Pogust Goodhead.&nbsp;I am very grateful to the firm for the opportunities to work on the BHP and NOx liability workstreams. I have learned an extraordinary amount during my time here. I will ensure I give a thorough handover to those who are continuing to work on the Ford, Volvo and Quantum workstreams.&nbsp;By my calculation, my last day at the firm will be 27th&nbsp;February 2026.&nbsp;Kind regards&nbsp;Harriet &nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Harriet&nbsp;HarperAssociate+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7484&nbsp;085&nbsp;193&nbsp;"}

