&nbsp;


The SRA Code of Conduct at 1.4 says &quot;You do not mislead or attempt to mislead your
clients, the
court&nbsp;or others, either by your own acts or omissions or allowing or being complicit in the acts or omissions of others (including your
client)&quot;


&nbsp;


By this letter having gone out, and by repeat correspondence continuing to go out in my name on the Ford and Volvo litigations, and the names
 of the other case leads, without appropriate context that we are working our notice, I have real concerns that the firm is (and I am) in breach of 1.4 of the code of conduct. This applies not only to correspondence to the Defendant firms, but also to clients
